TrevorMDev, at commit 8091ee8, its version on the RuneLite Plugin Hub, BSD
2-Clause licensed. Some of Tile Packs' files came into it from RuneLite,
mostly its Ground Markers plugin, and keep those authors too: TheLonelyDev,
Adam, Jordan Atwood and Benjamin (genetic-soybean).

These keep the license headers they have in Tile Packs. Each set of
copyright notices follows with its license, after the files that carry it.

